span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fear_of_failure.\" title=\"Fear of failure.\">Fear of failure.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Pork is a sausage.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_pistachio_eclair.\" title=\"A pistachio eclair.\">A pistachio eclair.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Welcome_to_Rico_Face.\" title=\"Welcome to Rico Face.\">Welcome to Rico Face.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/There%27s_strength_in_arches.\" title=\"There&#39;s strength in arches.\">There's strength in arches.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Pork is a sausage.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d8/Pork_is_a_sausage..png/revision/latest?cb=20210116014659\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Pork is a sausage.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d8/Pork_is_a_sausage..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210116014659\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d8/Pork_is_a_sausage..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210116014659 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d8/Pork_is_a_sausage..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210116014659 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Pork is a sausage.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Pork_is_a_sausage..png\" data-image-name=\"Pork is a sausage..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_2\" title=\"Series 2\">2</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jon_Richardson\" title=\"Jon Richardson\">Jon Richardson</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fear_of_failure.\" title=\"Fear of failure.\">Fear of failure.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_pistachio_eclair.\" title=\"A pistachio eclair.\">A pistachio eclair.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Pork is a sausage.</b></i> is the second episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_2\" title=\"Series 2\">Series 2</a> of <i>Taskmaster</i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 28 June 2016. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Jon_Richardson\" title=\"Jon Richardson\">Jon Richardson</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Pork_is_a_sausage.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Pork is a sausage\" was a statement made by a pizza restaurant worker to an exasperated <a href=\"/wiki/Doc_Brown\" title=\"Doc Brown\">Doc Brown</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/Order_the_following_pizza_for_the_Taskmaster\" title=\"Order the following pizza for the Taskmaster\">Order the following pizza for the Taskmaster</a> task. The title card shows a dead fish, referencing Brown's attempt of the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_music_video_for_a_nursery_rhyme\" title=\"Make the best music video for a nursery rhyme\">Make the best music video for a nursery rhyme</a> task in which he made a music video for <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One,_Two,_Three,_Four,_Five\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:One, Two, Three, Four, Five\">One, Two, Three, Four, Five</a></i> nursery rhyme.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Pork_is_a_sausage.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Svinekød er en pølse', which translates as 'Pork is a sausage'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Possu on makkaraa', which translates as 'Pork is a sausage'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Svin er pølse', which translates as 'Pork is sausage'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Pork_is_a_sausage.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Doc_Brown\" title=\"Doc Brown\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Doc Brown</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Wilkinson\" title=\"Joe Wilkinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Wilkinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jon_Richardson\" title=\"Jon Richardson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jon Richardson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Katherine_Ryan\" title=\"Katherine Ryan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Katherine Ryan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Osman\" title=\"Richard Osman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Richard Osman</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Trendiest_item_of_clothing\" title=\"Trendiest item of clothing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Trendiest item of clothing.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eat_me\" title=\"Eat me\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Eat me (an egg).\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_music_video_for_a_nursery_rhyme\" title=\"Make the best music video for a nursery rhyme\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the best music video for a nursery rhyme.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Using_this_camera,_take_a_picture_of_an_inanimate_object_that_looks_like_you\" title=\"Using this camera, take a picture of an inanimate object that looks like you\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Using this camera, take a picture of an inanimate object that looks like you.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Order_the_following_pizza_for_the_Taskmaster\" title=\"Order the following pizza for the Taskmaster\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Order the following pizza for the Taskmaster: Extra large vegetarian pizza with pepperoni and bacon, and without tomato and cheese. You may not use the following words: EXTRA, LARGE, VEGETARIAN, PIZZA, PEPPERONI, BACON, TOMATO, CHEESE\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Make the pizza person say the word \"bubbles\".</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Using_these_big_chopsticks,_get_these_potatoes_into_your_basket\" title=\"Using these big chopsticks, get these potatoes into your basket\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Using these big chopsticks, get these potatoes into your basket. You must only hold the big chopsticks on the grips provided. The big chopsticks alone may touch the potatoes in turn.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">25\n</td>\n<td>19\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Pork_is_a_sausage.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is the first episode with a title first said by someone other than the main cast, in this case a pizza restaurant worker.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data